{
  "adaptations": [
    "Move immutable public task assets from /app to /frontier/task.",
    "Move the writable cumulative ledger to /workspace/payload/solution.json.",
    "Replace Harbor submit/wait/list commands with generic frontier-submit train/final.",
    "Wrap the single JSON file in a deterministic application/x-tar payload.",
    "Split train and eval into distinct immutable mode-selector dataset objects.",
    "Write FrontierCS2 result JSON plus deterministic zstd-compressed evidence.",
    "Replace the three-pending queue-width limit with 100 accepted asynchronous total train calls.",
    "Score the explicit final ledger; historical-best payload selection remains unsupported.",
    "Separate mathematical statement from operational README for the direct-payload profile.",
    "Place Agent license inside the public task build subtree.",
    "Add complete converted-source inventory and explicit pending-scoring migration status.",
    "Submit the ledger as payload/solution.patch, a unified diff against the published starter ledger; the Verifier applies it to its own starter copy before scoring (every task uses patch submissions).",
    "Keep solver-facing operational and scientific guide copies consistent with patch submission and asynchronous train acceptance; reject malformed non-diff text rather than treating it as an unchanged starter."
  ],
